Scope of this license

The MIT License above covers the source code of this repository (the scripts,
the stylesheets, the client-side JavaScript, the page templates) and the text
written for the atlas.

It does NOT cover third-party material that the project includes or derives
from, which stays under its owners' terms:

- Pokémon names, artwork, data and cries are property of Nintendo, Game Freak,
  Creatures Inc. and The Pokémon Company (src/arte/, src/gritos/, dados/).
- The Cobblemon models, textures, item icons, structures and data belong to the
  Cobblemon team and are distributed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
  (src/arte/modelo/, src/modelos3d/, src/maquetes/, dados/cobblemon.json).
- The fonts in src/fontes/ are under the SIL Open Font License; each one has
  its license file next to it.

This is an unofficial, non-profit fan project.
